// (`22-tx-concurrency.md` §1): [1] idempotency → [1b] tenant_settings → [2] payroll_periods → [3] payroll_runs → [7] hasil/jobs.
//
// InputProvider (query Input*) membaca tabel modul lain (employee, compensation, tenancy) secara
